              150.81277465820312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "While an autopilot is engaged, a pilot’s attention should not disengage. Pilots need to maintain situational awareness and ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
