          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "appropriate focus on the progress of the flight at all times. Balancing the use of automation with manual flying skills is necessary ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
